sequenceDiagram
    participant L as LiftTracker
    participant B as BarTracker
    participant M as MediaPipe Pose
    L->>M: procesar frame
    M-->>L: landmarks (joints + wrists)
    L->>B: detect_barbell(frame)
    alt barra detectada
        B-->>L: posicion del barbell (x, y)
        L->>L: FramePose.barbell = posicion real
    else no detectada
        L->>L: fallback proxy de manopla
    end
